Description:\nWhat Happens When You Come Home for the Right Reasons? Dr. Willa Hayes returns to Maple Creek not to escape her life, but to finally live it. After years in a demanding city veterinary practice, she inherits her grandfather's small-town clinic and begins again in a place where relationships matter and every choice has weight. She does not expect Reece Dalton. A widowed rancher devoted to his land, his animals, and his seven-year-old daughter, Reece is not searching for love. He is simply trying to raise a child, honor the past, and keep his heart steady after loss. What begins with a sick horse and a pre-dawn emergency call slowly becomes something neither of them plans for. A connection formed through shared responsibility, quiet conversations, and small daily moments that begin to matter more than anything else. Healing Small Hearts is a gentle, emotionally grounded small town romance about: Returning home with intention, not regret Finding love after loss without erasing the past Building family through patience, trust, and presence Discovering that healing does not arrive loudly, but steadily This is not a story of dramatic twists or rushed passion. It is a story of belonging. Of community. Of love that grows slowly and feels safe enough to stay. If you enjoy heartfelt contemporary romance with warmth, emotional depth, and a strong sense of place, Healing Small Hearts offers a quiet, satisfying journey toward love that lasts. Genre: Contemporary Romance, Small Town Romance Themes: Healing after loss, second chances, found family Setting: Rural small town, ranch life, veterinary clinic Tone: Gentle, emotional, hopeful Length: Full-length novel Audience: Adult readers who enjoy emotionally grounded romance A heartfelt small town romance centered on healing, family, and quiet love Features a veterinarian heroine and a widowed rancher learning to love again Explores second chances without erasing grief or past loss Ideal for readers who enjoy slow-burn, emotionally \n\nEvaluate whether this book satisfies the user's search intent.\n\nReturn:\n\n* score (0, 1, or 2)\n* concise reason\n", 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'gpt-4o-mini', 'response_format': {'type': 'json_schema', 'json_schema': {'schema': {'description': 'Structured relevance judgment for a single (query, book) pair.\n\nThe ``reason`` field is mandatory so every judgment can be audited\nor used for fine-tuning the judge model later.', 'properties': {'score': {'description': 'Relevance score: 0 = not relevant, 1 = somewhat relevant, 2 = highly relevant.', 'title': 'Score', 'type': 'integer'}, 'reason': {'description': 'Concise explanation (1-3 sentences) justifying the score. Used for auditing and debugging.', 'title': 'Reason', 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['score', 'reason'], 'title': 'RelevanceScore', 'type': 'object', 'additionalProperties': False}, 'name': 'RelevanceScore', 'strict': True}}, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0.0}}
