an Historical Romance Novel\n\nDescription:\nEnjoy this Victorian historical romance novel from bestselling author Tracy Cooper-Posey! He is less than a commoner and should be beneath her notice. In Valor of Love, Lady Lillian Innesford, the eldest daughter of the prestigious Williams family, has lived in seclusion for seven years, hiding a secret that has drained her spirit. Once a prominent figure in society, she now works as a governess, distancing herself from her former life. Jasper Thomsett, the newly appointed butler for the Williams family, is the only one who understands the true nature of Lilly's troubles. Having retired with the highest honors after serving in the Crimean War, Jasper seeks a quiet life. However, the revelation of Lillys secret threatens to upend everything. Valor of Love is the second book in the Scandalous Scions series, a captivating spin-off from the acclaimed Scandalous Sirens historical romance series. Set in the Victorian era, this series weaves together the lives and loves of three great families, exploring their passions and challenges amidst a society bound by strict moral codes. Reader Advisory: This story contains frank sex scenes and sexual language. This story is part of the Scandalous Scions series: 0.5 Rose of Ebony 1.0 Soul of Sin 2.0 Valor of Love 3.0 Marriage of Lies 4.0 Mask of Nobility 5.0 Law of Attraction 6.0 Veil of Honor 7.0 Season of Denial 8.0 Rules of Engagement 9.0 Degree of Solitude 10.0 Ashes of Pride 11.0 Risk of Ruin 12.0 Year of Folly 13.0 Queen of Hearts A Sexy Historical Romance ___ Praise for Valor of Love: I have to admit crying like a baby through some passages of the book, they are so well-written that you can feel the characters emotions. I won't ruin the story but even if you feel historical romances aren't your thing trust me this will change your mind. I'm glad I took the chance and read it. Wow! I was so moved by their story that I cried happy tears!! I'm so totally in love with these characters! The characters stepped out of the books' fi\n\nEvaluate whether this book satisfies the user's search intent.\n\nReturn:\n\n* score (0, 1, or 2)\n* concise reason\n", 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'gpt-4o-mini', 'response_format': {'type': 'json_schema', 'json_schema': {'schema': {'description': 'Structured relevance judgment for a single (query, book) pair.\n\nThe ``reason`` field is mandatory so every judgment can be audited\nor used for fine-tuning the judge model later.', 'properties': {'score': {'description': 'Relevance score: 0 = not relevant, 1 = somewhat relevant, 2 = highly relevant.', 'title': 'Score', 'type': 'integer'}, 'reason': {'description': 'Concise explanation (1-3 sentences) justifying the score. Used for auditing and debugging.', 'title': 'Reason', 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['score', 'reason'], 'title': 'RelevanceScore', 'type': 'object', 'additionalProperties': False}, 'name': 'RelevanceScore', 'strict': True}}, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0.0}}
