:\nPrepare to embark on an emotional journey of love, loss, and the indomitable human spirit with "Fragments of Love." This exquisitely crafted novel weaves together the delicate threads of relationships, leaving an indelible mark on the reader\'s heart.In a world where connections are made and shattered, where hearts collide and mend, "Fragments of Love" invites you to explore the profound complexities of the human experience. Through a series of interconnected stories, each character unveils their most vulnerable fragments of love, exposing the raw beauty and resilience that lies within us all.From the depths of heartbreak to the euphoria of new beginnings, this poignant collection of tales delves into the intricate tapestry of human emotions. Meet Emma\'s, a woman seeking solace after a devastating breakup, and witness her transformation as she rediscovers her own strength. Follow Ethan\'s, a struggling artist, as he navigates the turbulent waters of self-doubt and finds inspiration in unexpected places. Experience the bittersweet reunion of childhood sweethearts, as fate weaves their lives together once more.As you delve deeper into the lives of these captivating characters, you\'ll find yourself reflecting on your own journey through love and its various shades. Each story is a fragment, a piece of the grand tapestry of human connection, leaving an indelible impression on the reader\'s soul.With lyrical prose and evocative imagery, "Fragments of Love" explores the universal themes of longing, passion, and the pursuit of happiness. It will captivate your mind and tug at your heartstrings, reminding you that even in our most shattered moments, love has the power to heal, transform, and illuminate the fragments of our existence.This exceptional novel is a must-read for those who appreciate thought-provoking literature that explores the complexities of the human heart. Allow "Fragments of Love" to envelop you in its tender embrace, and discover the beauty that lies within \n\nEvaluate whether this book satisfies the user\'s search intent.\n\nReturn:\n\n* score (0, 1, or 2)\n* concise reason\n', 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'gpt-4o-mini', 'response_format': {'type': 'json_schema', 'json_schema': {'schema': {'description': 'Structured relevance judgment for a single (query, book) pair.\n\nThe ``reason`` field is mandatory so every judgment can be audited\nor used for fine-tuning the judge model later.', 'properties': {'score': {'description': 'Relevance score: 0 = not relevant, 1 = somewhat relevant, 2 = highly relevant.', 'title': 'Score', 'type': 'integer'}, 'reason': {'description': 'Concise explanation (1-3 sentences) justifying the score. Used for auditing and debugging.', 'title': 'Reason', 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['score', 'reason'], 'title': 'RelevanceScore', 'type': 'object', 'additionalProperties': False}, 'name': 'RelevanceScore', 'strict': True}}, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0.0}}
